  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakukhona indoda ethile yaseRamathayimi, umuntu waseZufi kwelasezintabeni zakoEfrayimi; ibizo layo lalinguElkana indodana kaJerohamu, kaElihu, kaTohu, kaZufi wakoEfrayimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayilabafazi ababili; ibizo lomunye linguHana, lelomunye linguPenina. UPenina wayelabantwana, kodwa uHana wayengelabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leyondoda yayejwayele ukusuka emzini wayo iminyaka yonke ukuyakhonza lokuhlabela iNkosi yamabandla umhlatshelo eShilo, lapho amadodana amabili kaEli, uHofini loFiniyasi, ayengabapristi beNkosi khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakusithi mhla uElkana ehlabela iNkosi, anike uPenina umkakhe lawo wonke amadodana lamadodakazi akhe izabelo zenyama; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lanxa uHana wayemthanda, wamnika isabelo saba sinye kuphela, ngoba iNkosi yayisivalile isizalo sakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UPenina umbangisi wakhe wayejwayele ukumconula kakhulu ukuze amthukuthelise, ngoba iNkosi yayisivalile isizalo sakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaqhubeka ngokunjalo iminyaka ngeminyaka; ngezikhathi zonke lapho esiya endlini yeNkosi umbangisi wakhe wayemconula. Ngakhoke uHana wakhala, wala ukudla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElkana umkakhe wasesithi kuye: Hana, ukhalelani na? Kawudli ngani na? Inhliziyo yakho idaneleni na? Mina kangedluli amadodana alitshumi kuwe na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi sebedlile banatha eShilo, uHana wasukuma. UEli umpristi wayehlezi esihlalweni sakhe phansi kwensika yomnyango wethempeli leNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHana wayedabukile kakhulu, wasekhuleka eNkosini ekhala kakhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesenza isithembiso esithi: Nkosi yamabandla, uba ungabona ukuhlupheka kwencekukazi yakho, ungikhumbule, ungangikhohlwa mina incekukazi yakho, unginike indodana, minake ngizayinika iNkosi insuku zonke zokuphila kwayo, kayiyikuliphuca lekhanda layo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 6:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi esaqhubeka ukukhuleka phambi kweNkosi, uEli waqaphelisa umlomo wakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHana wayekhulumela ngaphakathi, kuthinteka indebe zakhe kuphela, ilizwi lakhe lalingezwakali; ngakho uEli wacabanga ukuthi udakiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEli wasesithi kuye: Uzadakwa kuze kube nini na? Suka lapha lize liphele kuwe iwayini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHana wamphendula wathi: Atshi, nkosi yami, ngingowesifazana ohluphekayo; kanginathanga wayini loba utshwala obudakayo, kodwa bengiseneka umphefumulo wami eNkosini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ungayikhangeli incekukazi yakho njengowesifazana omubi, ngoba bengikade ngikhulunyiswa yibukhulu benhlupheko zami losizi lwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEli wasemphendula esithi: Hamba kuhle; uNkulunkulu wakoIsrayeli akunike lokho okucelileyo kuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: Incekukazi yakho kayifumane umusa kuwe. Owesifazana wasehamba; kwaphela ukudana kwakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bavuka ekuseni; bakhuleka eNkosini, basebebuyela emzini wabo eRama. UElkana wangena loHana umkakhe engutsheni, leNkosi yamkhumbula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi isikhathi sesiphelele uHana wakhulelwa, wabeletha indodana, wayitha ibizo wathi nguSamuweli; ngoba wathi: Ngimcelile eNkosini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElkana wasuka kanye lendlu yakhe yonke ukuyanikela eNkosini umhlatshelo weminyaka yonke, lokugcwalisa isithembiso sakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uHana kayanga, ngoba wathi kumkakhe: Kangiyikuhamba aze akhunyulwe ebeleni umntwana; ng’khonake ngizakumusa ukuba abonakale phambi kweNkosi, abesesala khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElkana umkakhe wathi kuye: Yenza lokho okubona kulungile kuwe; hlala uze umkhumule ebeleni; kungathi iNkosi ingaqinisa ilizwi lakho. UHana wasala, wayondla indodana yakhe waze wayikhumula ebeleni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eseyikhumule ebeleni wasuka layo, wayisa endlini yeNkosi eShilo kanye lenkunzi eleminyaka emithathu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " lempuphu, lembodlela yewayini; wamusa umntwana endlini yeNkosi eShilo esemncinyane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayihlaba inkunzi, bamusa umntwana kuEli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHana wathi: E nkosi yami, mana njalo nkosi yami! Yimi owesifazana owayemi lapha phambi kwakho, ekhuleka eNkosini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhulekela lumntwana; iNkosi inginikile lokho engakucela kuyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke lami ngimnikele eNkosini; zonke insuku zokuphila kwakhe uzakuba ngoweNkosi. Bakhonza iNkosi lapho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
